# AI Assistant Rules - XYIAN Discord Bot

## Key files

- `xyian-bot-project/bot.js` — The entire bot (single file)
- `xyian-bot-project/data/knowledge.json` — Game facts
- `xyian-bot-project/data/feedback.json` — Q&A feedback log
- `xyian-bot-project/CHANGELOG.md` — Update after every task

## Channel behavior

| Channel | Bot replies? | Notes |
|---------|-------------|-------|
| #arch-ai | Yes (verified roles) | Q&A via OpenAI + knowledge.json |
| General chat | Commands only | !help, !menu, !ping |
| Guild recruit | Never | Cron recruitment only |
| Other channels | Commands only | |

## Roles

- Everyone: !ping, !help, !menu
- Verified role: Q&A, !faq, !listfacts
- Admin (XYIAN OFFICIAL / Admin): !addfact, !removefact, !recruit, !reset

## Rules

- Update changelog after every completed task
- Keep bot.js as single file (split only if >600 lines)
- Errors go to admin webhook, never shown to users
- Never commit tokens; use env vars
